  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity under preparation Safety First: GBV Safety Infrastructure in the Pacific</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Overall Objective of this action is to contribute to the prevention and response of Gender-Based Violence in the Pacific by providing sustainable, climate-resilient, survivor-centered safety infrastructure that protects survivors, prevents re-victimization and strengthens access to essential services.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
